{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "%@\n\n请重试；如果反复出现，到「设置」里检查屏幕录制权限状态。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\n\nPlease try again. If this keeps happening, check the Screen Recording permission in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@\n截图仍在剪贴板里，可以直接粘贴。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\nThe screenshot is still on the clipboard and can be pasted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cropmark 截图": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cropmark Screenshot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cropmark 设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cropmark Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cropmark 需要「屏幕录制」权限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cropmark Needs Screen Recording Permission"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Retina 屏幕的截图像素是显示尺寸的两倍，缩小到 1x 后贴进聊天、文档不会变大，体积也小得多。附带文件后，粘贴到 Finder、Slack、终端这类只认文件的地方也能用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On Retina displays a screenshot has twice the pixels of its on-screen size. Downscaling to 1x keeps it from looking oversized in chats and documents and makes it much smaller. With a file attached, you can also paste into Finder, Slack, and terminals that only accept files."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次检查": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last checked"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Medium"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从未": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Never"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存为 PNG 文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save as a PNG file"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存到文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save to File"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存失败": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save Failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存文件时缩小到 1x": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downscale to 1x when saving"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关于": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写入 %@ 失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Failed to write %@: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "剪贴板同时附带 PNG 文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Also put a PNG file on the clipboard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勾选后系统会要求退出并重新打开 Cropmark，重新打开后按快捷键即可截图。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After enabling, macOS will ask you to quit and reopen Cropmark. Press the shortcut after reopening to capture."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单击": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "双击": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Double-click"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消 Esc": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel Esc"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "右键": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Right-click"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复制到剪贴板时缩小到 1x": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downscale to 1x when copying"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成 Enter": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done Enter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成，复制到剪贴板": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finish and copy to clipboard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尚未授权，按快捷键不会有反应": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not granted. The shortcut will do nothing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "屏幕录制": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screen Recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已授权，可以截图": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Granted. Ready to capture."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开源许可": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "License"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "快捷键": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shortcut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "截图": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capture"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "截图失败": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capture Failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "截图完成后播放提示音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play sound after capture"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "截图快捷键": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capture shortcut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "截图时的按键": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keys While Capturing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "截屏%@.png": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screenshot %@.png"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开系统设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "撤销 ⌘Z": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Undo ⌘Z"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "撤销上一步标注": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Undo the last annotation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "文字": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法把截图编码为 PNG。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not encode the screenshot as PNG."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更新": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Updates"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not set"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "权限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permission"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "框选区域；松手后可拉伸、移动选区": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select a region; resize or move it after releasing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查更新…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check for Updates…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "椭圆": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ellipse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正方形 / 正圆 / 45° 箭头": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Square / circle / 45° arrow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每天检查一次 GitHub 上有没有新版本，只请求版本清单，不发送任何数据。也可以随时从菜单栏「检查更新…」手动检查。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checks GitHub once a day for a new version. Only the version list is requested; no data is sent. You can also check anytime from the menu bar via “Check for Updates…”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有找到可以截取的显示器，请重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No display available to capture. Please try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "版本 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画笔": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登录时自动启动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Launch at login"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "矩形": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rectangle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "稍后": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Later"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "立即检查": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check Now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第三方许可": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Third-Party Licenses"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "箭头": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "粗": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thick"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统要求在「登录项与扩展」里手动允许 Cropmark，允许后这里会自动变为开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS requires you to allow Cropmark manually under Login Items & Extensions. This switch turns on automatically once allowed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "细": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动检查更新": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check for updates automatically"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "若其他应用也注册了同一快捷键，按下时两边都会响应，或被对方拦截而 Cropmark 收不到：在对方设置里改掉，或在这里换一个。F1–F12 可以单独作为快捷键。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If another app registers the same shortcut, both will respond, or the other app may intercept it so Cropmark never sees it. Change it in that app, or pick a different one here. F1–F12 can be used on their own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "行为": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Behavior"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设置…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 屏幕录制」中勾选 Cropmark。系统会要求退出并重新打开 Cropmark，重新打开后再按快捷键。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable Cropmark under System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen Recording. macOS will ask you to quit and reopen Cropmark; press the shortcut again after reopening."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轻量截图工具，随时按 %@ 截图、标注、复制": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lightweight screenshot tool. Press %@ anytime to capture, annotate, and copy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "输出": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Output"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "退出 Cropmark": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quit Cropmark"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选中光标下的窗口": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select the window under the cursor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新框选；再按一次退出": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start a new selection; press again to exit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "项目主页": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Project Page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "马赛克": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mosaic"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
